$( <MM> <PROOF_ASST> THEOREM=vebklem8  LOC_AFTER=?

* Lemma for vebkz (core): if every character mod N agrees with the nonzero value G ( i ) at some F ( i ), then some nonempty set of indices has F-product congruent to 1 mod N.

